# Funnel metrics
{.lead} A probe for the mdp:chart block: a pure-CSS bar chart from label and value pairs, accent-coloured by the theme.

```mdp:chart
Visitors: 1000
Signups: 420
Activated: 280
Paid: 120
```

---

## Retention by week

The same syntax as stats, but each value becomes a proportional bar so the trend reads at a glance.

```mdp:chart
Week 1: 88
Week 2: 71
Week 3: 64
Week 4: 59
```
